      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Telling users to \"get a VPN 4Head\" is pretty dumb but for the most part even if someone has your IP address they can't really do much besides DDOS you which is yeah annoying, but you can get a new address by literally rebooting your router/modem. If you don't have access to it you can call your ISP to get a new one. \n \nIF someone wanted to do some damage they \"could\" but they would need to know wayyyy more than just \"haha i googled this EPIC program\" which is probably isn't the case for the script kiddies that download some modded client off the internet. \n\nIt's an issue that should be fixed but I don't think it's something to worry /too/ much about.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
