      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat doesnt have control over what steam does with IP addresses. If you have an issue with that, go harass steam, but its not like they would care to begin with.\n\nSafest way would to either call your ISP for a new IP address or run a VPN. There is some free ones out there with some data limits ofc, but its easily doable with some VPN providers.",
